flowchart TD
    accTitle: Claims triage application architecture
    accDescr: Claim intake, validation, coverage and briefing lead to human review. Versioned knowledge and SQLite provide evidence and memory. All four roles share a runtime port with local mock and Azure choices.
    UI["Streamlit / CLI"] --> API["Authenticated API /<br/>application service"]
    API --> S["Supervisor:<br/>route request"]
    S --> I["Intake:<br/>validate claim"]
    I --> G{"Validation<br/>checkpoint"}
    G -->|Valid| C["Coverage and<br/>anomaly specialist"]
    G -->|Invalid: coverage skipped| B["Adjuster briefing<br/>specialist"]
    C --> B
    K["Versioned underwriting<br/>knowledge"] -->|Retrieved rules and citations| C
    M[("SQLite conversation<br/>and prior-claim memory")] --> B
    B --> H["Pending<br/>human review"]
    H --> D["Authenticated<br/>human decision"]
    D --> M
    S -.-> R["Runtime port"]
    R -.-> L["Local deterministic<br/>mock"]
    R -.-> A["Azure Agent Service:<br/>four agents and<br/>role threads"]
    A -.-> F["Hosted file-search<br/>vector store"]

    classDef entry fill:#eff6ff,stroke:#60a5fa,color:#17243b
    classDef agent fill:#f5f3ff,stroke:#a78bfa,color:#17243b
    classDef evidence fill:#ecfdf5,stroke:#34d399,color:#17243b
    classDef gate fill:#fffbeb,stroke:#fbbf24,color:#78350f
    class UI,API entry
    class S,I,C,B,R,L,A agent
    class K,M,F evidence
    class G,H,D gate
